  <item>
    <title>012. 港卡开卡经验谈丨保姆级攻略丨储蓄卡丨信用卡丨港美股投资</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661c002a48c40e2fb0479516</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661c002a48c40e2fb0479516</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Apr 2024 16:11:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是我们的第十二期播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>悟空前阵子到香港保司研学，顺道开了港卡，我们聊聊这次开卡的踩坑经验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容索引】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 为什么要开港卡？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> 开卡前都做了哪些准备？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a> 笑死，排队排错了门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> 水电收据因不是完整地址被中银业务员拒绝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 脑子要活，见机行事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1059">17:39</a> 「雇员计划」是怎么开卡的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a> 都有哪些材料要准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1466">24:26</a> 汇丰香港的ATM/柜员机，请谨慎操作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 平邮心慌慌，还要和EMS斗智斗勇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> 申请完信用卡，系统自动弹出来的补充材料链接千万别补</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文中提及的材料清单】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【必备】过关小票（过海关时机器会给，记得取）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【必备】身份证</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【必备】港澳通行证</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【必备】地址证明，水电燃气收据或纸质版信用卡账单等</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【可能要】雇主协议或劳动合同等证明职位和收入的文件</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【可能要】股票交易记录纸质版</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【可能要】股票账户截图、基金账户截图</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【可能要】银行存款截图</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【可能会问】开户目的、预计存入金额</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>如果你听过本期节目后有什么想说的话或者想问的，欢迎在评论区留言</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll8aBGbiqSJT0PaH9F2WtGlKAsea.m4a" length="31549015" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiqXXQLXW5GJlRROw4x0IQ22ETeo.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>12</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
