  </item>
  <item>
    <title>007. 我们错过的那些暴富机会丨认知差异丨价值观丨财富自由</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6572e5a2f6f2b065f0d465e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6572e5a2f6f2b065f0d465e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Dec 2023 09:45:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是我们的第七期播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主题可能是截至目前最好笑的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你在听过本期节目后有什么想说的话，欢迎在评论区留言。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容索引</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 做了自媒体，但没坚持做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> 认为今日头条 APP 太 Low，不想去字节跳动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> 瞧不起拼多多，错失移动互联网最后一波上升浪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a> 价值观保守，拒绝接触区块链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a> 身边故事：硕士毕业，3万块 all in 比特币</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 身边故事：用风投的方式买虚拟币</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> 投资是一种信仰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">28:53</a> B站知识区兴起，看到机会但不知道该怎么做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1847">30:47</a> 正在发生的机会——视频号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2027">33:47</a> 买房算吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">35:13</a> 总结：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>永远不要后悔和遗憾，财富和认知是匹配的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>机会永远存在</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>抓住机会的人往往经历了非常多的失败尝试</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>人的一生当然要靠自我奋斗，也要考虑时代的进程</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>普通人，还是要找到自己喜欢或者擅长做的事，坚持做下去</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目仅供交流目的，不构成任何形式的投资建议。任何个人或实体根据本信息所做出的决定，应当自行承担风险。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvKYvHUygXNfZF4s-jRicAAuBVsM.m4a" length="37034447" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:43</itunes:duration>
